{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/top_JP.png?t=1744965263\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The long-awaited game adaptation of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends is here!</strong></h2>Step into the shoes of Takashi Natsume and spend an unforgettable summer vacation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend an unforgettable summer as Takashi Natsume</strong></h2>The first term is over and summer vacation has finally begun.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/ADV_JP.gif?t=1744965263\" /><br>Natsume weaves heartwarming stories through his encounters with various people.<br>Unravel their stories when you complete their requests.<br>There are five possible endings.<br>Enjoy an original story unique to the game\u2014an experience you won\u2019t find anywhere else.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Strengthen Bonds Through \u201cGifts\u201d</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/gift_JP.png?t=1744965263\" /><br>Collect a variety of items by fulfilling requests or shopping in town.<br>Gift these to your friends and strengthen your bonds.<br>You might surprise them, make them smile, or receive an unexpected response\u2014<br>New requests appear as your bonds strengthen!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Packed with Classic Summer Events</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/summer.gif?t=1744965263\" /><br>Festivals, test of courage, fireworks displays...<br>Enjoy a lineup of nostalgic summer events.<br>Each moment is sure to become a lasting memory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Beautifully Recreated World of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/field.gif?t=1744965263\" /><br>Warm and gently nostalgic.<br>Immerse yourself in the vibrant world and live out your days as \u201cNatsume.\u201d<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Journey Through Fond Memories</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/memory.gif?t=1744965263\" /><br>Those precious encounters, those heartfelt emotions...<br>Some requests will bring back memorable scenes from Seasons 1 through 7 of the anime.<br>Relive Natsume\u2019s journey and reflect on the path he has walked.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344960?t=1744965263","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744965263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/b467548292c0fcb2ebbfdd487debd549155696f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744965263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/b467548292c0fcb2ebbfdd487debd549155696f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744965263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/top_JP.png?t=1744965263\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The long-awaited game adaptation of Natsume\u2019s Book of Friends is here!</strong></h2>Step into the shoes of Takashi Natsume and spend an unforgettable summer vacation.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Spend an unforgettable summer as Takashi Natsume</strong></h2>The first term is over and summer vacation has finally begun.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344960/extras/A